title: 'c2c init --json emits non-JSON: human log lines + two concatenated JSON objects on stdout'
---
Ran c2c init --client claude --json. stdout contained human lines like [c2c register] no --alias given and warning: relay identity init failed interleaved with TWO separate JSON objects. Not parseable as a single JSON document. With --json, stdout should be exactly one valid JSON document; diagnostics/log lines go to stderr. Repro: c2c init --client claude --json